  "question": {
    "text": "The escape velocity from the surface of earth is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>.</mo></math> A body is projected with velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>.</mo></math> With what constant velocity will it move in the inter planetary space?"
